<BaseLayout title="Meet Sheila Bruce | A Sheila Bruce Affair"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Meet Sheila Bruce</p><h1>The woman behind the affairs.</h1><p class="lead">Sheila Bruce brings warmth, style, and intention to every gathering she hosts.</p></div><div class="hero-card founder full-dress-photo"><img src="/assets/brand/sheila/sheila-twirling-black-dress.jpg" alt="Sheila Bruce twirling in an elegant black dress"></div></section><section><div class="split"><div><h2>Authentic. Sophisticated. Fabulous.</h2><p>Originally from Bedford-Stuyvesant, Brooklyn, Sheila has lived many lives with grace — as a model, teacher, homemaker, wife, mother, grandmother, and natural connector of people.</p><p>Before A Sheila Bruce Affair, Sheila brought women together through Sisters of Sarasota. That spirit continues today through curated social events, private gatherings, wellness conversations, and fabulous affairs across Florida’s Gulf Coast.</p><p>Now retired alongside her husband Gerald, a retired pharmaceutical executive, Sheila brings a lifetime of taste, hospitality, and lived elegance to her work.</p><p>Her gift is not simply planning an event. It is creating a room where people feel seen, welcomed, stylish, and connected.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact Sheila</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/contact?intent=host_event_inquiry">Have Sheila Host an Event</a></div></div><div class="card"><p class="script">Sheila’s Style</p><ul><li>Elegant, but never stiff</li><li>Fabulous, but never forced</li><li>Women-centered, but warmly welcoming</li><li>Rooted in Black friendship, culture, and community</li><li>Designed for people who love to dress up, show up, and celebrate beautifully</li></ul></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
